cpcbas: the CPC BASIC compiler for the Amstrad CPC.

The compiler (packages/) is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public
License v3.0 or later (LICENSE). Its design follows Boriel BASIC 1.19
(https://github.com/boriel-basic/zxbasic, AGPL-3.0, José Manuel Rodríguez de
la Rosa and contributors); parts of its code generator and peephole rules are
ported from it.

The runtime library (lib/) is licensed under the MIT License (lib/LICENSE).
It contains the Z80 runtime of Boriel BASIC (MIT) and the Amstrad CPC
runtime and libraries written for CPCBuild.

The language is compatible in spirit with Locomotive BASIC 1.1 (Locomotive
Software / Amstrad). Locomotive and Amstrad are trademarks of their owners;
this project is not affiliated with them.
